@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/courier#> .
@prefix courier: <http://example.org/orexis/courier#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .

<> a orexis:BeliefGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is
<> orexis:ownedBy :courier .    # and whose it is — said here, never by the file's name

#  THE DELIVERY AS POSED: the van at the origin, the parcel two cells away. The first state
#  graph, and the only file here the runtime never reloads — from the first boot on, where the
#  van and the parcel stand is the agent's belief, rewritten by its own actions.

:van courier:x 0 ; courier:y 0 .
:parcel courier:x 1 ; courier:y 2 .
